  "title": "Creamy Conchiglie Pasta Salad",
  "description": "Perfect for cookouts, family gatherings, and Sunday dinners, this deliciously seasoned conchiglie pasta salad is tossed with crisp vegetables in creamy, mayo-based dressing.",
  "authors": [
